{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And it also flows with milk and honey.</b> They said to Moses: all the good things that you spoke in the name of HaShem — not a single one fell to the ground, and as we heard, so we saw. And this is what they said: ״We came to the land to which you sent us,״ for had there been any discrepancy in any matter, it would have appeared as though this were not the land to which you sent us, since it lacked those attributes; and in addition to your words, it is even flowing with milk and honey. But in one matter we did not find according to your words: for you said that this sign is tested and proven, that in a place where the people are mighty, they dwell in unwalled cities. Concerning this they said: ״Only that the people dwelling in the land are fierce, and the cities are fortified, very great,״ for the word ״אֶפֶס״ serves like אַךְ and רַק — 'but' and 'only.'" "And look to the right and see: for they said ״cities great and fortified exceedingly,״ and in the parashah of Deuteronomy (Deuteronomy 1:28) Moses said that the spies said ״cities great and fortified in the heavens״ — and we do not find that they said 'in the heavens'; rather, Moses understood from their words a denial of the Holy One, blessed be He, for they said ״he is stronger than we,״ as it were, as if even the Master of the house cannot remove His vessels from there (Sotah 35a). And they said that this strength comes to them from the stars of the heavens and their constellations, and this is what is meant by ״and fortified in the heavens״ — that their astrological sign in the heavens is stronger than He, as it were. And at first they did not state this denial explicitly, but said merely ״fortified, very great,״ and when Caleb came and contradicted their words, they stated the denial explicitly: ״for he is stronger than we.״ And from the end of their words it is evident that the beginning of their words was likewise denial, as though they had said ״and fortified in the heavens.״"], :book :numbers, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:41:09.512365850Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}